    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di R17 created: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione testuale all'evento compositivo che l'ha prodotta. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of R17 created: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the compositional event that produced it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ],
